.SH NAME
QStrListIterator \- Iterator for the QStrList and QStrIList classes
\fBClasses\fR - Annotated - Tree - Functions - Home - \fBStructure\fR </div>
.br
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qstrlist.h>\fR
.PP
